    {
        "content": "<p>Hi <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"124696\">@Juneyoung Lee</span>, I'm the person working on Lean's string lemmas. There is a lot of material to cover, and unfortunately none of the lemmas you need exist yet. I started working on <code>toNat?</code> lemmas yesterday and will be done in a bit. <code>startsWith</code> and <code>drop</code> lemmas will follow soon. If all goes well, Lean 4.30 will have what you need.</p>",
